    }
  },
  "docs": "Kumo components need exactly one theme item: kumo-theme (Kumo's own look), kumo-cloudflare (Kumo with the Cloudflare dashboard's sidebar) or kumo-binding (follows your shadcn theme). See https://github.com/tom-ricci/kumo-shadcn#themes",
